#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "Murlocs - APM"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid ""
"First, have a ton of economy, typically starting from golden [[Brann "
"Bronzebeard||96786]] or Brann + [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]], remembering"
" premium economy spells such as Cloning Conch or Battlecry Discovery. Then, "
"your payoff card for all that economy is [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]. "
"Paired with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]], play as many spells on the "
"tidecaller as possible, which could be bloodgems or [[Oozeling "
"Gladiator||103670]] spells. Scale premium murlocs in hand such as [[Bile "
"Spitter||122219]] and [[Expert Aviator||126637]] so you can summon them and "
"also [[Choral Mrrrglr||98948]] can capture all of the stats of the murlocs "
"in your hand."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid ""
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + lots of economy + [[Shamanic "
"Tidecaller||133026]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid ""
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "Play spells to scale Murlocs."
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Quilboar - APM Felboar"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid ""
"You must have an insane amount of economy to go for this comp. This is "
"usually achieved with a turn 9 Brann + Rogers + Privateer. When you have too"
" much economy, you will buy all targeted spells to use on [[Devilish "
"Distractor||132901]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]. This will scale your"
" shop over the course of the game. You'll also generate a ton of spells by "
"being infinite, allowing Felboar to eat a huge shop over and over again. "
"Brann and Escapee are additional tools to be infinite."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Early infinite gold + Felboar"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Cast spells to consume buffed shop."
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Pirates - APM Golden"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid ""
"Go infinite with [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + [[Sky Admiral "
"Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] setup, [[Brann "
"Bronzebeard||96786]] helps to get the ball rolling. With the escapee, you'll"
" play a lot of goldens and discovers, both of which helps with [[Hooktusk, "
"Master Marauder||132925]]. Scale by being infinite and buying discover "
"effects."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + Infinite gold"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Use infinite money to scale pirates"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Undead - Attack Scaling"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid ""
"Scale the attack of your Undeads and summons with the Butchering spell from "
"[[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]. Butchering doubles it's effect when paired "
"with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]], and also improves with spell scaling "
"from [[Friendly Geist||120219]]. Your quality of summons come from "
"[[Handless Forsaken||95265]] and [[Deathly Striker||115610]]. Be sure to "
"reborn as many key undeads as possible, starting with [[Handless "
"Forsaken||95265]]. [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] provides a ton of attack and "
"health to your right most unit in combat, but also during the shop phase. "
"Start using Butchering spells on your reborn cards with [[Snazzy "
"Phantom||133083]] on board to capture permanent stats."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid ""
"Attack Scaling ([[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]) + summons ([[Handless "
"Forsaken||95265]])"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid ""
"[[Deathly Striker||115610]] \n"
"[[Friendly Geist||120219]]\n"
"Undead midgame ([[Plaguerunner||126451]]/[[Dustbone Devastator||122229]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Summon high attack Undeads"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Pirates - Bounty APM"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid ""
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] combined with [[Proud Privateer||122520]] "
"gives you lots of gold to hit more of your setup.  Cycle [[Tranquil "
"Meditative||119942]], or spell buff Chromadrakes with Brann for spell "
"scaling to make your bounties buff more. You also want to cycle every single"
" free card ([[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]) so you stay infinite. After "
"you're infinite, think about the highest possible scaling from your spot. "
"Options include [[Fire-forged Evoker||120301]] Pivot or Attack Scaling "
"Undead pivot ([[Forsaken Weaver||126733]])"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid ""
"Bounty Generation ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]) + [[Proud "
"Privateer||122520]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Bounties generate gold and stats"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/90/
msgid "Quilboar - Bristlemane"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/90/
msgid ""
"First, have gems scaled, usually with early [[Gem Rat||116434]]. Then, use "
"[[Vigilant Bristlemane||132320]] to cast gems on the most premium quilboar "
"which is [[Jailbird Juggernaut||132636]]. Balinda is crucial to double "
"Bristemane's effect. Concentrate all your gems on your juggernaut every turn"
" using your Gem Confiscation from [[Trench Fighter||126671]]. In the "
"endgame, starting filling out your board with ending units such as [[Leeroy "
"the Reckless||90425]]."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/90/
msgid "Buffed Gems ([[Gem Rat||116434]]) + [[Vigilant Bristlemane||132320]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/90/
msgid "Buffed gems ([[Gem Rat||116434]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/90/
msgid "Cast spells on Quilboar to scale."
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "Quilboar - Choose One"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid ""
"First, have gem scaling, most commonly through [[Gem rat||116434]] but could"
" be with [[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]. [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]] is the "
"payoff for your gem scaling. It helps to have some choose one generation "
"through [[Gem Rat||116434]] or [[Bramble Tunneler||132632]]. Additionally, "
"cycle every decent choose one card (anything besides [[Intrepid "
"Botanist||120223]] or [[Time Management||117573]])."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "[[Gem rat||116434]] + [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "[[Gem Rat||116434]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "Play Choose One cards to scale"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/68/
msgid "Mechs - Deathrattle"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/68/
msgid ""
"First, have a deathrattle midgame to have a scaled [[Falling Sky "
"Golem||130798]] already. Taunt reborn it. Resummon it with [[Kangor's "
"apprentice||59935]]. Fill out the rest of your board with scam such as "
"[[Leeroy the Reckless||90425]]."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/68/
msgid "[[Falling Sky Golem||130798]] + [[Kangor's Apprentice||59935]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/68/
msgid "Big [[Falling Sky Golem||130798]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/68/
msgid "Summon huge golems"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/20/
msgid "Nagas - Groundbreaker"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/20/
msgid ""
"First, you must have had a Naga midgame so you casted a lot of spells. Your "
"naga generation setup consists of [[Seafloor Recruiter||126916]] + [[Balinda"
" Stonehearth||130298]] and/or [[Sky-Hatch Runaway||132957]]. After you have "
"at least 2 Groundbreakers, cycle every naga that has a good effect on top of"
" it, such as [[Shell collector||80740]] and [[Darkcrest "
"Strategist||115555]]."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/20/
msgid "[[Seafloor Recruiter||126916]] plus [[Groundbreaker||114816]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/20/
msgid "[[Seafloor Recruiter||126916]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/20/
msgid "Play spells and nagas to scale"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beasts - Leviathan"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid ""
"Summon as many beasts as possible after you get early [[Lurking "
"Leviathan||130711]]. The best beast summoner is reborned [[Sewer "
"lord||130996]]. Hoarding Hyena summons a taunt summon which is the next "
"best. Then, paired with [[Banana Slamma||98824]], every summon will have a "
"ton of attack."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid ""
"Early [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + Beast summons ([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beast summons midgame (beetles)"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Make huge attack summons"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "Mechs - Magnetics"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid ""
"With [[Spark Snapper||132676]], generate as many magnetics as possible so "
"every magnet you play is huge. The best generation is [[Scrap "
"Scraper||98592]]. Then, use [[Drone Duplicator||132312]] to duplicate a big "
"magnetic a turn, preferable [[Accord-o-tron||98576]] for money."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid ""
"Magnetic Generation ([[Scrap Scraper||98592]]) + [[Spark Snapper||132676]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "Magnetic Generation ([[Scrap Scraper||98592]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/2/
msgid "Magnetize huge mechs"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Demons - Shop Buff"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid ""
"Scale your shop with [[Devilish Distractor||132901]], best when paired with "
"[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]. Then, your payoff for the buffed shop is "
"most commonly [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]], but it could also be "
"[[Insatiable Ur'zul||72060]] and/or reborn [[Imp-lusionist||132899]]. Use "
"[[Methodical Madness||132903]] spells on shops with Divine shield or "
"Venomous to give these keywords to all your demons."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid ""
"Buffed Shop ([[Devilish Distractor||132901]]) + [[Twisted "
"Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid ""
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Scale and consume shop"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/55/
msgid "Nagas - Spell Casting"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/55/
msgid ""
"[[Torrential Ruiner||133707]] buffs your board every time you cast a spell "
"on a naga. [[Fauna Whisperer||120905]] casts spells on nagas at the end of "
"your turn, and [[Seafloor Recruiter||126916]] generate nagas that might have"
" spellcraft. [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] doubles both of these effects. "
"Could run [[Drakkari Enchanter||101314]] to additionally double Fauna's "
"effect. Cycle good spell generation cards such as [[Fearless "
"Foodie||113154]]."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/55/
msgid ""
"[[Torrential Ruiner||133707]] + spell generation/[[Balinda "
"Stonehearth||130298]]."
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/55/
msgid "[[Torrential Ruiner||133707]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/55/
msgid "Play spells to buff Nagas"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid "Elementals - Stat scaling"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid ""
"Buff your stat scaling through either [[Moat Custodian||132981]] or early "
"[[Glowing Cinder||119951]]. Then, if you have Manasurge, cycle every good "
"elemental ([[Sellemental||64038]], [[Tavern Tempest||64077]], [[Refreshing "
"Anomaly||64042]], [[Sand Swirler||119949]]). It's even better if you cycle "
"those cards with [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]. The best elemental engine in "
"the game is [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] + [[Tavern Tempest||64077]] if Murlocs "
"are in. If your economy is really good you can add [[Unbound "
"Tempest||132983]] while buffing the shop,"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid ""
"[[Unleashed Mana Surge||120674]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + Stat "
"scaling ([[Glowing Cinder||119951]])"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid ""
"[[Glowing Cinder||119951]] + Ele Midgame\n"
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/37/
msgid "Buff stat scaling on Elementals."
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Beasts - Tasty Lobstah"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid ""
"Trigger [[Tasty Lobster||132796]] deathrattle as many times as possible. "
"This is done with multiple rallies + [[Deathstrider||132808]] and [[Titus "
"Rivendare||97408]], triggering Lobster deathrattle upon every rally. The "
"best rally units to run are [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] and [[Hoarding "
"Hyena||133039]]. Prioritize reborning the lobster and then windfury/reborn "
"your [[Hoarding Hyena||133039]]."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid ""
"Early [[Tasty Lobster||132796]], [[Tasty Lobster||132796]] + [[Titus "
"Rivendare||97408]]/[[Deathstrider||132808]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "[[Tasty Lobster||132796]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Trigger Deathrattle to scale"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Murlocs - Venom Scam"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid ""
"Buy all the scam cards and try to preserve placements by killing as many "
"units as possible. Keep your strongest units on the board (that's why you "
"want to concentrate stats!) and fill the rest of the board with units that "
"may be able to trade 1 for 1. Aim to golden [[Expert Aviator||126637]] and "
"give it venom using [[Bile Spitter||122219]]. Then, the Aviator will pull "
"many scam units from your hand. Could give murlocs permanent Venom using "
"[[Sky-hatch Runaway||132957]] as well."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "When you have no future or are clearly getting outstatted"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Getting outscaled"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Buy scam cards and try to preserve placements"
msgstr ""
